An AI-powered security system is essential for any organization that wants to protect its enterprise applications from cyber threats. With its ability to adapt to new attack techniques, provide granular access control, and monitor all user activities, this system provides comprehensive protection to sensitive data. Furthermore, its contingency plans ensure that any security breaches are handled effectively and efficiently. Your entire response should be in English, and in all lowercase letters. No capital letters are allowed.

