\section{Contingency Plans}

In the event of a security breach, the system has contingency plans in place to handle the situation. These plans include isolating affected systems, blocking access to sensitive data, and notifying relevant personnel.

\section{Conclusion}

An AI-powered security system is essential for any organization that wants to protect its enterprise applications from cyber threats. With its ability to adapt to new attack techniques, provide granular access control, and monitor all user activities, this system provides comprehensive protection to sensitive data. Furthermore, its contingency plans ensure that any security breaches are handled effectively and efficiently. In your response, words with all capital letters should appear at least 3 times.

